ack my card delivery?\",\n    \"My card is damaged, can I get a new one?\",\n    \"How many cards can I have?\",\n    \"Is there a top up limit for my card?\",\n]\n# NEG_OTHER = other departments and other account_security topics.\nNEG_OTHER = [\n    # fees_fx incl. earlier correction 1\n    \"The exchange rate on my card payment was terrible.\",\n    \"I was given a wrong exchange rate when I withdrew cash abroad.\",\n    \"The amount on my card payment looks wrong because of the exchange rate.\",\n    \"Why did my ATM withdrawal in euros use such a bad rate?\",\n    \"What currencies do you support?\",\n    \"Can I hold dollars in my account?\",\n    \"How much is the fee for a transfer?\",\n    \"Why was I charged a fee for withdrawing cash?\",\n    \"What exchange rate do you use?\",\n    \"Is there a fee for exchanging currency?\",\n    \"Which currencies can I exchange?\",\n    \"Do you charge for card payments abroad?\",\n    # disputes\n    \"There is a payment I don't recognise on my statement.\",\n    \"I was charged twice for the same purchase.\",\n    \"My card payment was declined.\",\n    \"A transaction has been pending for days.\",\n    \"I want a refund for an item I returned.\",\n    \"There is a cash withdrawal I didn't make.\",\n    \"A direct debit I didn't set up came out of my account.\",\n    \"My payment was reverted.\",\n    # transfers_topups\n    \"How do I top up my account?\",\n    \"My transfer hasn't arrived yet.\",\n    \"Can I send money to another country?\",\n    \"My balance didn't update after a bank transfer.\",\n    \"How do I receive money from a friend?\",\n    \"My top up failed.\",\n    \"How long does a transfer to Germany take?\",\n    \"Can I top up with a cheque?\",\n    \"I made a deposit but it is not showing.\",\n    \"Can I transfer money to a US bank account?\",\n    # account_security other\n    \"How do I verify my identity?\",\n    \"I forgot my passcode.\",\n    \"I want to close my account.\",\n    \"I lost m