n    \"Which nationalities can open an account?\", \"Can US residents get an account?\", \"Is this only for UK residents?\",\n    \"Can I apply if I'm not a resident?\", \"Where can I use your services?\", \"Where is the service offered?\",\n    \"What countries can I use the card in?\", \"Which countries does the card work in?\", \"Can I get support in my country?\",\n    \"Do you have locations near me?\", \"Where are your locations?\", \"Is the service offered worldwide?\",\n    \"Can I get an account if I'm under 18?\", \"Can my teenage son get a card?\", \"What's the age requirement for a card?\",\n    \"How old do my children need to be to have an account?\", \"Can I set up an account for my 12 year old?\",\n    \"Is there a junior account?\", \"Can a student under 18 sign up?\", \"Do you have restrictions on age?\",\n]\ndef pos():\n    out = list(POS_HAND)\n    for t in CTRY_T:\n        out += [t.format(c=c) for c in rnd.sample(COUNTRIES, 5)]\n    for t in AGE_T:\n        out += [t.format(a=a) for a in rnd.sample(AGES, 3)]\n    return out\nPOS2 = pos()\n\nNEG_HAND = {\n \"cards\": [\n    \"When will my card arrive?\", \"How do I activate my new card?\", \"My card isn't working.\", \"Can I add my card to Apple Pay?\",\n    \"How do I get a virtual card?\", \"My card was stolen.\", \"I lost my card.\", \"How do I order a replacement card?\",\n    \"Contactless isn't working.\", \"My card still hasn't been delivered.\", \"Can I use my card abroad?\", \"Which ATMs accept the card?\",\n    \"My card expired.\", \"How long does delivery of the card take?\", \"How do I get a disposable card?\", \"How do I link my card?\",\n    \"Can I use Google Pay?\", \"The ATM kept my card.\", \"I'd like a physical card.\", \"How do I change my PIN?\", \"My PIN is blocked.\",\n    \"I forgot my PIN.\", \"Where can I change my PIN?\", \"Can I choose my PIN?\", \"Can you deliver my card to another address?\",\n    \"Does the card work in Spain?\", \"Can I track my card?\", \"My card is broken.\", \"How many virtual cards can I have?\",\n    \"Do you deliver cards to France?\", \"Can I get my card sent to Germany?\", \"How long will my card take to arrive in the US?\",\n    \"I'm travelling to Japan, will my card work there?\", \"Can I use the card at ATMs in Italy?\", \"I found my card, can I reactivate it?\",\n    \"My card is frozen, how do I unfreeze it?\", \"Can I get a second card for my partner?\", \"Can my child get an additional card on my account?\",\n    \"Is there a fee to replace a card?\", \"My virtual card isn't working online.\", \"Why was my card blocked?\", \"My card got declined at the ATM because of the PIN.\",\n    \"Can I use Apple Pay in Canada?\", \"What do I do if my card is about to expire?\", \"The card delivery is late.\", \"How do I unlock my PIN?\",\n    \"My card payment didn't work in a shop in Mexico.\", \"Can I use my card for online shopping?\", \"Can I order a card with a different design?\",\n    \"Is the card a Visa or Mastercard?\",\n ],\n \"fees_fx\": [\n    \"The exchange rate on my card payment was bad.\", \"I got a wrong exchange rate on a cash withdrawal.\", \"Why is the exchange rate so poor?\",\n    \"What currencies do you support?\", \"Can I hold euros?\", \"What is the fee for transfers?\", \"Why was I charged a fee?\",\n    \"What exchange rate do you use?\", \"Is there a fee for currency exchange?\", \"Which currencies can I exchange?\",\n    \"Do you charge fees abroad?\", \"Why did I get charged extra for using my card in the US?\", \"What are your fees for ATM withdrawals?\",\n    \"Is there a monthly fee?\", \"How much does it cost to exchange dollars to pounds?\", \"Why was the amount converted at a strange rate?\",\n    \"Do you support Japanese yen?\", \"Can I exchange to Swiss francs?\", \"Is there a charge for topping up by card?\",\n    \"The rate I got in Turkey was terrible.\",\n ],\n \"disputes\": [\n    \"There is a payment I don't recognise.\", \"I was charged twice.\", \"My card payment was declined.\", \"A transaction is pending.\",\n    \"I want a refund.\", \"There's a withdrawal I didn't make.\", \"A direct debit I didn't set up was taken.\", \"My payment was reverted.\",\n    \"A merchant charged me twice in Spain.\", \"Why is my payment still pending?\", \"My refund hasn't arrived.\", \"I don't recognise this transaction from Germany.\",\n    \"My transfer was declined.\", \"Why was my payment declined abroad?\", \"The ATM didn't give me my cash but I was charged.\",\n    \"I see a strange charge on my account.\", \"A seller refuses to refund me.\", \"My cash withdrawal shows as pending.\",\n    \"I was charged for something I cancelled.\", \"A payment I made has been reversed.\",\n ],\n \"transfers_topups\": [\n    \"How do I top up?\", \"My transfer hasn't arrived.\", \"Can I send money abroad?\", \"My balance didn't update after a transfer.\",\n    \"How do I receive money?\", \"My top up failed.\", \"How long does a transfer to Germany take?\", \"Can I top up by cheque?\",\n    \"My deposit isn't showing.\", \"Can I transfer money to the US?\", \"Can I top up with a card from another country?\",\n    \"How do I send money to a friend in France?\", \"Why is my top up pending?\", \"Can I add money by bank transfer?\",\n    \"My top up from Apple Pay failed.\", \"How do I get my salary paid into my account?\", \"Can I send money to India?\",\n    \"My bank transfer to Canada is taking too long.\", \"What are the top up limits?\", \"Where can I find my account details to receive a transfer?\",\n ],\n \"account_security\": [\n    \"How do I verify my identity?\", \"I forgot my passcode.\", \"I want to close my account.\", \"I lost my phone.\", \"How do I change my address?\",\n    \"Why do you need my ID?\", \"My identity verification failed.\", \"How do I update my phone number?\", \"Someone else has access to my account.\",\n    \"Can I change my email?\", \"Delete my account.\", \"Can I have two accounts?\", \"My passcode doesn't work.\", \"My verification is pending.\",\n    \"What documents do I need for verification?\", \"How do I reset my passcode?\", \"I moved house, how do I update my address?\",\n    \"My phone was stolen, is my account safe?\", \"Can I change my name on the account?\", \"Why was my account locked?\",\n ],\n}\nNEG2 = [(t, d) for d, ts in NEG_HAND.items() for t in ts]\n"}}}
